    "title": "statement, 不过 + qualification",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-connectors-p07-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "statement, 不过 + qualification",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "不过 after a statement adds a reservation. It qualifies the main point without necessarily rejecting it.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "书很好，不过太贵了。",
                "pinyin": "shū hěn hǎo ， bùguò tài guì le 。",
                "meaning": "The book is good, but it is too expensive.",
                "audio": "85745bfedd1efded06a0a902d127d0d541205df46061e0179b30346e5bf0c488"
              },
              {
                "text": "我想去，不过没时间。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng qù ， bùguò méi shíjiān 。",
                "meaning": "I want to go, but I do not have time.",
                "audio": "9f62e0aa18dc3deac5282ba4680b05143ae23ccd38a79643062b5a1ff880bd57"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
